                </p>
                
                <p class="orangetext">If you are a consumer or patient please visit
                    <a class="audience-context-switch consumer" href="/dailymed/drugInfo.cfm?setid=d81a6a79-a74a-44b7-822c-0dfa3036eaed&audience=consumer"
