<img alt="Spravato 84mg" src="/dailymed/image.cfm?name=Spravato+84mg+3x+US+AW+PDF+-+10494503+-+Box.jpg&amp;setid=d81a6a79-a74a-44b7-822c-0dfa3036eaed"/></p>
</div>
                                </li>
                            
                        
                            
